The '''TzHaar-Ket''' are [[TzHaar]] who serve as the guards of [[Mor Ul Rek]].{{CiteNPC|npc=TzHaar-Mej-Jal|quote=There are the mighty TzHaar-Ket who guard us, the swift TzHaar-Xil who hunt for our food, and the skilled TzHaar-Hur who craft our homes and tools.|loc=|notes=|name=}} They attack with [[melee]].

A TzHaar-Ket can become [[Aggressiveness|aggressive]] when any nearby [[TzHaar-Hur]] or [[TzHaar-Mej]] is attacked up to six tiles away from the TzHaar-Ket. 

All TzHaar have an uncommon chance to drop [[uncut sapphire]]s, [[uncut emerald]]s, and [[uncut ruby|uncut rubies]] as well as a rare chance to drop [[uncut diamond]]s. The drop rates listed below for materials ([[gems]] and [[Onyx bolt tips]]) increase by 33% when wearing a [[ring of wealth]].

There are stronger TzHaar-Ket located in the [[Mor Ul Rek#Inner Area|inner area of the city]] which drop pieces of the [[obsidian armour set]]. In order to access these, a [[fire cape]] must be shown at the barrier to the inner city.

It is possible to safespot the TzHaar-Ket by standing behind [[sulphur vent|sulphur vents]] found within [[Mor Ul Rek]]. While fighting a TzHaar-Ket, players can go into the [[Fight Caves]] and die to fully heal themselves and recharge [[Prayer]].

